{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13104010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13104010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1310401001:1":{"text":"化装舞会是什么样的？满满还从来没有参加过……嗯，是不是要穿奇怪的衣服，再把自己的脸画成特别夸张的样子？","source_cn":"化装舞会是什么样的？满满还从来没有参加过……嗯，是不是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9D17663C4DB3076","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310401002:1":{"text":"哈哈，不用穿“奇怪的衣服”，只要换套适合舞会的就可以了。或者，戴上一个面具。","source_cn":"哈哈，不用穿“奇怪的衣服”，只要换套适合舞会的就可以了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DACB7A3859BA812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310401003:1":{"text":"咦，戴着面具跳舞？","source_cn":"咦，戴着面具跳舞？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF0CE9A032061510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310401004:1":{"text":"在第一次神魔战争胜利以后，这里的人会在庆典中打扮成恶魔的样子巡游，被众人从街头“驱赶”到街尾。","source_cn":"在第一次神魔战争胜利以后，这里的人会在庆典中打扮成恶魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A8FA1D909AC4392","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310401005:1":{"text":"这种巡游后来逐渐演变为现在的舞会。而舞会嘛……你们应该知道，无论男士或者女士，比起扮成丑陋的恶魔，更愿意在舞会上展示自身的魅力。","source_cn":"这种巡游后来逐渐演变为现在的舞会。而舞会嘛……你们应该...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1D07AA8282A4623","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":